{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Go Slimey Go!</i> is an easy-to-pick-up game for all players! Easy to learn and hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by family-friendly platformers like Yoshi's Island and Kirby, it combines charm with challenge, with intuitive controls and progressively tougher levels that surprise players and test their skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/7ee22f81cbfce7c8579d4fb9137898fe.gif?t=1773332880\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/7ee22f81cbfce7c8579d4fb9137898fe.poster.avif?t=1773332880\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce your way through many meticulously hand crafted levels across five different worlds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't fight, avoid all conflict to reach your goal! Enemies are (mostly!) harmless, but little slippery you are harmless as well!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squishiness is your strongest weapon! Bounce onto, into and across enemies to reach new heights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive  boss battles where you are not the target! Try not to get caught in the ultimate showdown between good and evil!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/bed33cbc9d71950b264908dc06e4d993.poster.avif?t=1773332880\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/bed33cbc9d71950b264908dc06e4d993.webm?t=1773332880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/bed33cbc9d71950b264908dc06e4d993.mp4?t=1773332880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just go, Slimey, go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/484ff24ee28b91324d92cdb2d664a050.poster.avif?t=1773332880\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/484ff24ee28b91324d92cdb2d664a050.webm?t=1773332880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/484ff24ee28b91324d92cdb2d664a050.mp4?t=1773332880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Meet the Devs!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215230/73002e65a6499a48f0ff66b6a7709e354745c98a.jpg"},{"name":"Snowman Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215230/93ad92f3f739416e2001db4b4ab910b930545138.jpg"},{"name":"Started Slimin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215230/4f80f058c7d77366bb9c3af8bae20fc55eb3570a.jpg"},{"name":"One World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215230/db7ce5b388c337fc676a287a99fc0c893716eaa2.jpg"},{"name":"Nighty Night!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215230/afca39db6f487b584eb36ec1b90c803417796dc5.jpg"},{"name":"Chill Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215230/a879fd5933daf87b5c4e94da2d18fbbabaad583f.jpg"},{"name":"Heating Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215230/09ed1dc838c14256602389e76483cd57f50c67f8.jpg"},{"name":"Castle Siege!","path":"h